Issues a new campus token bound to the calling client (provider must be `campus`).

POST /credentials/{provider}/{user_id}/
Authorization: operator only (#854).

Body: {
    "client_id": "client_id",
    "scopes": [...],
    "expires_in": 3600
}
Returns: {
    "credentials": { ... }
}

